LucSys Robotics — Technical Model Usage Terms

The URDF and 3D mesh files in this package are provided for technical evaluation, simulation, and integration of LucSys Robotics platforms.

These files are not distributed under an open-source license.

Redistribution, resale, or public republication of these files, whether modified or unmodified, requires prior written permission from the applicable rights holder(s).

